# Local-only tooling. scripts/ and docs/ are deliberately NOT ignored: docs
# are tracked, and scripts/ holds repo maintenance commands wired into
# package.json. A new file under an ignored directory is skipped by
# `git add` silently, which is how scripts/checkRoster.js was lost.
